### MediScan AI — API Tests
### Install "REST Client" VS Code extension, then click "Send Request"

@base = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

###

### Get all model metrics
GET {{base}}/metrics

###

### Predict diabetes (positive case)
POST {{base}}/predict/diabetes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Pregnancies": 6,
  "Glucose": 148,
  "BloodPressure": 72,
  "SkinThickness": 35,
  "Insulin": 0,
  "BMI": 33.6,
  "DiabetesPedigreeFunction": 0.627,
  "Age": 50
}

###

### Predict diabetes (negative case)
POST {{base}}/predict/diabetes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Pregnancies": 1,
  "Glucose": 85,
  "BloodPressure": 66,
  "SkinThickness": 29,
  "Insulin": 0,
  "BMI": 26.6,
  "DiabetesPedigreeFunction": 0.351,
  "Age": 31
}

###

### Predict heart disease (high risk)
POST {{base}}/predict/heart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 63,
  "sex": 1,
  "cp": 3,
  "trestbps": 145,
  "chol": 233,
  "fbs": 1,
  "restecg": 0,
  "thalach": 150,
  "exang": 0,
  "oldpeak": 2.3,
  "slope": 0,
  "ca": 0,
  "thal": 1
}

###

### Predict kidney disease (CKD positive)
POST {{base}}/predict/kidney
Content-Type: application/json

